Changes made in this port:
  - Rewritten from TypeScript/Canvas 2D to Dart/Flutter (CustomPainter + Ticker).
  - Platform adaptation layers (WEB / UNI / TARO / MP-WX) and the Vue-style
    observer system were removed; Flutter's widget lifecycle replaces them.
  - Configuration models, layout geometry and animation algorithms follow the
    upstream behaviour; the rendering and extension architecture is new.

