Example assets (example/assets/imgs, example/assets/official_ref):
  The images under example/assets/imgs are the demo artwork published with the
  upstream project's documentation site (https://100px.net, npm package
  "buuing@0.0.3"), and example/assets/official_ref holds screenshots of that
  site. They are included ONLY so the example app can reproduce the official
  demos 1:1 for verification. The upstream site states these images are for
  learning and exchange only and must not be used commercially; many imitate
  third-party brands. They must not be reused in commercial
  products and are not part of luckdraw's library code (lib/).
